kind: seq
id: bus-frame
title: One register read on the UART link
alt: >-
  Sequence of one UART read: the host sends a framed read command for TEMP_MSB with a CRC and the XMPL100 replies with
  a framed answer of three bytes and a CRC.
reads: >-
  Two participants, the host and the XMPL100. The host sends the frame 0xA5, 0x85 (read TEMP_MSB), a length of 3 and a
  CRC. The chip answers with the frame 0xA5, TEMP_MSB, TEMP_LSB, TEMP_CRC and a CRC. A missing reply within 5 ms is a
  timeout.
print: landscape
